THOSE ON HIGH PROTEIN DIETS"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"HIGH IN BCAAs"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"INSTANTIZED FOR EASY MIXING"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"95% LACTOSE FREE"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"ASPARTAME-FREE"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"MICROFILTERED FOR FASTER ABSORPTION AND DELIVERY"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"PROTEIN POWDER"},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"NOTICE: Use this product as a food supplement only. Do not use for weight reduction."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Naturally and artificially flavored"},{"type":"Formula re: Type","notes":"Whey is popular with bodybuilders, people on high protein diets, and anyone looking for a quick, easy-to-use nutritional drink. Our Whey Isolate Powder is specifically designed for anyone looking for high quality nutrition to support their workout and fitness goals."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Whey Isolate is designed for those looking for an advanced nutritional drink. Isolated Whey results in less of the fat and lactose that you don’t need."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"For an extra treat, blend with fruit or your favorite non-fat frozen yogurt."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Precision Engineered has pioneered the manufacture of premium sports nutrition supplements. Our commitment to quality is the highest in our industry. Every product undergoes rigorous analysis for purity, potency, safety and freshness. We guarantee it!"},{"type":"Seals/Symbols","notes":"QA Quality Assured"},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"No Artificial Color, No Preservatives, No Soy, No Gluten, No Wheat, No Yeast, No Fish."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Typical Amino Acid Profile Per 36 g Serving:\nL-Alanine 1,453 mg\nL-Arginine 806 mg\nL-Aspartic Acid 3,056 mg\nL-Cystine 612 mg\nGlutamic Acid 5,174 mg\nL-Glycine 533 mg\n1L-Histidine 518 mg\n1L-Isoleucine 1,686 mg\n1L-Leucine 3,143 mg\n1L-Lysine 2,759 mg\n1L-Methionine 666 mg\n1L-Phenylalanine 912 mg\nL-Proline 1,685 mg\nL-Serine 1,505 mg\n1L-Threonine 2,021 mg\n1L-Tryptophan*** 486 mg\nL-Tyrosine 846 mg\n1L-Valine 1,699 mg\n***L-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added.\n1Essential Amino Acids\nAmino Acid Profile Per 72 g Serving:\nL-Alanine 2,906 mg\nL-Arginine 1,612 mg\nL-Aspartic Acid 6,112 mg\nL-Cystine 1,224 mg\nGlutamic Acid 10,348 mg\nL-Glycine 1,066 mg\n1L-Histidine 1,036 mg\n1L-Isoleucine 3,372 mg\n1L-Leucine 6,286 mg\n1L-Lysine 5,518 mg\n1L-Methionine 1,332 mg\n1L-Phenylalanine 1,824 mg\nL-Proline 3,370 mg\nL-Serine 3,010 mg\n1L-Threonine 4,042 mg\n1L-Tryptophan*** 972 mg\nL-Tyrosine 1,692 mg\n1L-Valine 3,398 mg\n***L-Tryptophan is naturally occurring, not added.\n1Essential Amino Acids"},{"type":"Precautions re: Children","notes":"Keep out of reach of children."},{"type":"Storage","notes":"Store at room temperature."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"Do not use if package is torn or open."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Contents are sold by weight. Some settling may occur."},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"*Use in conjunction with an intense daily exercise program and a balanced diet including an adequate caloric intake."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"2016 Precision Engineered Limited (USA)"},{"type":"Suggested/Recommended/Usage/Directions","notes":"DIRECTIONS: For adults, add one (1) scoop (36 g) to 8 fluid ounces of water or your favorite beverage. Mix in your Precision Engineered shaker or a blender and drink immediately for best results. You can drink Precision Engineered Whey Protein any time during the day to add extra high quality protein to your daily calorie intake. Be sure to figure the extra calories provided by milk, juice or whatever you may add to your Precision Engineered Whey Protein. Increase or decrease the amount of liquid added to achieve desired consistency."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Servings Per Container about 25 about 13"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Calories 2,000 Calories 2,500\nTotal Fat Less than 65g 80g\nSat Fat Less than 20g 25g\nCholesterol Less than 300mg 300mg\nSodium Less than 2,400mg 2,400mg\nPotassium 3,500mg 3,500mg\nTotal Carbohydrate 300g 375g\nDietary Fiber 25g 30g\t\nProtein 50g 65g \nCalories per gram: Fat 9 ~ Carbohydrate 4 ~ Protein 4\n"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Contains milk ingredients."},{"type":"Precautions re: Allergies","notes":"Contains milk ingredients."},{"type":"General: Product/Version Code","notes":"Prod. # 31194 B55640 08B"},{"type":"Formula re: Contains","notes":"Whey is derived from milk and is loaded with strength-building protein, which plays a role in optimal nutrition.* Whey Isolate contains Branched Chain Amino Acids – made up of Leucine, Isoleucine and Valine which are important components of muscle tissue.*"}],"claims":[{"langualCode":"P0065","langualCodeDescription":"Nutrient "},{"langualCode":"P0115","langualCodeDescription":"All Other"}],"events":[{"date":"2016-12-23","type":"Date entered into DSLD"}],"userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"ingredientRows":[{"order":1,"ingredientId":284519,"description":null,"notes":null,"quantity":[{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":36,"operator":"=","quantity":140,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"},{"servingSizeOrder":1,"servingSizeQuantity":72,"operator":"=","quantity":280,"unit":"Calorie(s)","dailyValueTargetGroup":[],"servingSizeUnit":"Gram(s)"}],"nestedRows":[{"order":2,"ingredientId":284522,"description":null,"notes":n